  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-698efa5e-3908-8397-af10-72fb3ac87537-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-92\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"59974355-80e0-49da-9c54-c1de5a3071a0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"312\">De Nintendo Switch Lite Pokémon Zacian & Zamazenta Edition is een compacte handheld spelconsole met een uniek ontwerp gebaseerd op de populaire Pokémon-games. Deze uitvoering is speciaal ontworpen voor draagbaar gamen en ligt comfortabel in de hand.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"355\">Wat is het product, waarvoor geschikt</strong><br data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"358\">Deze console is geschikt voor gamers die voornamelijk handheld willen spelen. Ideaal voor onderweg, op reis of voor thuisgebruik zonder tv-aansluiting. Geschikt voor een breed aanbod aan Nintendo Switch-games die handheld ondersteund worden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"880\"><strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"630\">Korte productbeschrijving</strong><br data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\">De Switch Lite is een lichte en compacte variant van de Nintendo Switch, met vaste controllers en een helder scherm. De Pokémon Zacian & Zamazenta Edition onderscheidt zich door het exclusieve design en is geliefd bij Pokémon-fans en verzamelaars.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"896\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"925\"><strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"925\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"947\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1000\">⭐ Compact en licht ontwerp, ideaal voor onderweg</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1048\">⭐ Unieke Pokémon Zacian & Zamazenta Edition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1096\">⭐ Comfortabel voor langdurig handheld gamen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1141\">⭐ Groot aanbod aan Nintendo Switch-games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1168\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1203\">Platform: Nintendo Switch Lite</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1242\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1242\">Editie: Pokémon Zacian & Zamazenta</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1266\">Opslag: 32GB intern</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1292\">Uitbreidbaar: microSD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1328\">Connectiviteit: WiFi, Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1350\">Gebruik: Handheld</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1379\">Staat: Zo Goed Als Nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1404\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1437\">Nintendo Switch Lite console</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1457\">Voedingsadapter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1486\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1521\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
